{"3885280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TANK DOWN: METAL FURY", "steam_appid": 3885280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.mp4?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tank Down: Metal Fury</strong> is a tactical top-down tank shooter blending low-poly retro visuals with modern combat. As part of the Ironhold Order, you’ll battle the extremist Crimson Legion across collapsing cities, frozen bunkers, and desert strongholds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Warfare:</strong> Navigate terrain, dodge fire, and demolish destructible environments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.mp4?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Play the campaign solo or in 4-player co-op, compete in Capture-the-Flag PvP, or survive endless waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong> Fight massive machines like Leviathan-class tanks with multi-phase encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conflict Story:</strong> Push back the Crimson Legion as they race to awaken <strong>Project Revenant</strong>, a stolen AI war engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/217bf75958f2a98915f0946f8851f15b.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/217bf75958f2a98915f0946f8851f15b.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/217bf75958f2a98915f0946f8851f15b.mp4?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Style:</strong> Chunky polygon tanks and gritty textures inspired by classic early 3D, tuned with modern controls.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/73d9a12054e55eaab9773f6f5e9e48d5.mp4?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tank Down: Metal Fury</strong> is a tactical top-down tank shooter blending low-poly retro visuals with modern combat. As part of the Ironhold Order, you’ll battle the extremist Crimson Legion across collapsing cities, frozen bunkers, and desert strongholds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Warfare:</strong> Navigate terrain, dodge fire, and demolish destructible environments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/7d3d526a3e956d8b824318a412813316.mp4?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Play the campaign solo or in 4-player co-op, compete in Capture-the-Flag PvP, or survive endless waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong> Fight massive machines like Leviathan-class tanks with multi-phase encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conflict Story:</strong> Push back the Crimson Legion as they race to awaken <strong>Project Revenant</strong>, a stolen AI war engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/217bf75958f2a98915f0946f8851f15b.poster.avif?t=1762129530\" width=780 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885280/extras/217bf75958f2a98915f0946f8851f15b.webm?t=1762129530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/388